// emit: hir
// Every symbol of the program is unique (ADR 0051): a root item and an
// `#[export]` one, two `#[export]` ones and one `extern fn` declared in two
// modules are `resolve::duplicate-symbol`. A pair that is already
// `resolve::duplicate-item` is not reported again. `#[export]` applies only
// to functions and statics defined in the program, and takes no argument. `llvm` is reserved for modules of the root module only, and
// `_start` in every module.
